    "description": "Bakery, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 269 blocks vs 170. Plaster and timber cottage bakery with a brick oven built onto the back gable (furnace mouth, chimney past the ridge) and the smoker as workstation; L2 domes the oven, adds smoke, flour sacks, shutters, flower boxes, sign and bench; L3 a bread stall, wheat bales, banner, lanterns and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: brick_slab, brick_stairs, cornflower, dandelion, fern, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner, white_wool. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, sign_text.",
